From 36553ac6c730ffbdcbb5b839d561ee4f108c0a65 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Ren=C3=A9=20Rebe?= <rene@exactco.de>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 15:18:26 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] x86/msr-index: Add the Transmeta Crusoe PTT MSRs
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The Code Morphing Software of Transmeta Crusoe processors implements
Persistent Translation Technology (PTT) behind two private MSRs:
0x80868040 carries the commands and the state of the translation
database transfer, 0x80868042 the control functions (version, CR3
filter, statistics, start, abort).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>
---
 arch/x86/include/asm/msr-index.h | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

